sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CCTV as CCTV Camera Node
    participant Edge as Edge Preprocessor
    participant C3D as C3D Spatiotemporal Extractor
    participant MIL as Deep MIL Ranking Engine
    participant Severity as Risk Severity Engine
    participant AlertMgr as Alert Manager
    participant Operator as Human Operator (Co-Pilot)
    participant Archive as Intelligence Database

    Note over CCTV,Edge: 30-60 FPS Uncompressed Video Stream
    CCTV->>Edge: Continuous Frame Buffer
    Edge->>Edge: Batch into 16-frame Contiguous Clips
    Edge->>C3D: Feed (3, 16, 112, 112) Spatiotemporal Tensor
    Note over C3D: 3x3x3 Convolutions across Motion & Time
    C3D->>MIL: Output 4096-D Feature Vector V_i
    Note over MIL: Linear(4096->512) -> ReLU -> Linear(512->32) -> Sigmoid
    MIL-->>Severity: Instantaneous Anomaly Score f(V_i) ∈ [0, 1] (< 3.8ms)
    Severity->>AlertMgr: Evaluated Anomaly Score & Context
    
    alt Score < 0.50 [Nominal Baseline]
        AlertMgr->>AlertMgr: Maintain Temporal Moving Average Buffer
    else Score >= 0.50 [Anomaly Detected]
        AlertMgr->>AlertMgr: Check Debounce Hysteresis Window (48 frames)
        AlertMgr->>Operator: Dispatch Structured Threat Alert (Priority HUD)
        AlertMgr->>Archive: Log Telemetry & Feature Vectors
        
        Note over Operator: AI Transparency Protocol: Human Verification
        alt Threat Confirmed
            Operator->>AlertMgr: Feedback: CONFIRMED_THREAT (Law Enforcement Mobilized)
        else Environmental Occlusion
            Operator->>AlertMgr: Feedback: FALSE_POSITIVE_ENVIRONMENTAL (Rain/Low Light)
        else Behavioral False Positive
            Operator->>AlertMgr: Feedback: FALSE_POSITIVE_BEHAVIORAL (Normal Crowd Rush)
        end
        AlertMgr->>MIL: Recalibration Gradient Feedback Loop
    end
